<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="reference_qd5_gdq_cqb">
    <title><?oxy_comment_start author="zhangqin1@cmiot.cmcc" timestamp="20241101T141800+0800" comment="该内容模块为基础版本共用，请勿随意删减。若需添加仅适用于某型号的内容，请添加批注说明"?>AT+HTTPCFG<?oxy_comment_end?></title>
    <shortdesc>该命令用于查询或配置客户端参数。</shortdesc>
    <refbody>
        <table id="table_btl_krz_3qb">
            <tgroup cols="2">
                <colspec colname="c1" colnum="1" colwidth="3*" align="left"/>
                <colspec colname="c2" colnum="2" colwidth="7*" align="left"/>
                <thead>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"><cmdname>AT+HTTPCFG</cmdname></entry>
                    </row>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry>语法</entry>
                        <entry>响应</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry>设置命令<codeblock><cmdname>AT+HTTPCFG=&lt;id>,&lt;type>[,&lt;value>]</cmdname></codeblock></entry>
                        <entry>成功<div>如果输入格式正确返回：</div><msgblock id="msgblock_xmq_xb5_pqb">OK</msgblock>如果仅设置&lt;id>以及&lt;type>，则返回value查询结果。<msgblock id="msgblock_dk3_njw_43c">+HTTPCFG:&lt;id>,&lt;type>,&lt;len>,&lt;value>
OK</msgblock>失败<msgblock id="msgblock_mfp_dj3_ncc">ERROR</msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">命令描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">该命令用于查询或配置客户端参数。</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">参数描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                                ><varname>&lt;id></varname>整型，通过<msgph>+HTTPCREATE</msgph>返回的实例索引，范围：0~4。<fn>M5310-E/MN328-B范围：0~1。</fn></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                            ><varname>&lt;type></varname>整型，配置的参数类型。</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">
                            <dl>
                                <dlentry>
                                    <dt>6</dt>
                                    <dd>串口输出接收到的header及content字段时分包大小（默认为0，不分包）。分包的数据长度为10~1460字节。</dd>
                                </dlentry>
                                <dlentry>
                                    <dt>7</dt>
                                    <dd>串口输出接收到的header及content字段时分包延时时间间隔(ms)（默认为0，不延时）。最大支持3000ms。</dd>
                                </dlentry>
                                <dlentry>
                                    <dt>8</dt>
                                    <dd>串口输出接收到的header及content字段时是否转换为16进制输出（0不转换，1转换为16进制输出，默认为0）。</dd>
                                </dlentry>
                            </dl>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                                ><varname>&lt;value></varname>整型，<varname>&lt;type></varname>类型的值。</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                                ><varname>&lt;len></varname>整型，<varname>&lt;value></varname>参数的长度。</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">示例</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">创建实例
                            <msgblock id="codeblock_l2w_nfj_1rb"><cmdname>AT+HTTPCFG=0,6,512</cmdname>	/*配置数据输出包大小512字节。*/
OK	
<cmdname>AT+HTTPCFG=0,6</cmdname>	/*读取数据输出包大小。*/
+HTTPCFG:0,6,3,512	/*当前为512字节。*/
OK</msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                </tbody>
            </tgroup>
        </table>
        <section>
            <p>
                <note id="note_mwd_4wk_jcc">如果控制输出速率较低时，有可能引起HTTPDROP现象。目前HTTP头部数据不支持分包。</note>
            </p>
        </section>
    </refbody>
</reference>
